    "$$\\begin{aligned}&=\\pi \\int_{-1}^{1}{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{2-u^{2}}\\right)}du=2 \\pi-\\pi \\int_{-1}^{1}{\\frac{1}{\\left(\\sqrt{2}+u \\right)\\left(\\sqrt{2}-u \\right)}du}\\\\&=2 \\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{2 \\sqrt{2}}\\int_{-1}^{1}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}+u}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}-u}du}\\end{aligned}$$",
